# Timestamp-only files — resolve conflicts by keeping the most recent timestamp.
# The custom driver picks whichever side has the later 最后更新 value (YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM).
# Fallback: if the driver is not configured, we take "ours" to avoid blocking commits.
CLAUDE.md                merge=timestamp-ours
docs/ROADMAP.md          merge=timestamp-ours
docs/STATE.md            merge=timestamp-ours
docs/history/CHANGELOG.md merge=timestamp-ours
